        {"zh": "猎物进入我的视线！", "en": "Target in sight!"},
        {"zh": "月牙形的刃，先抬到眉间。", "en": "I raise the crescent blade to my brow."},
        {"zh": "鬼杀队成员，我要吃掉你！", "en": "Demon Slayer, I'll devour you!"},
